    gaussianCenterAverage_row_sq A h σ τ ρ τ (u i) (v j) v hh hσ hτ hρ hτ i,
    gaussianCenterAverage_col_sq A h σ τ ρ σ (u i) (v j) u hh hσ hτ hρ hσ j,
